<h3>Not here to just scroll through the future. <span class="highlight">I'm here to help build it.</span></h3>
<p>I'm Srejon Paroi Arpon, a Class 12 student with a big curiosity for how things work — and an even bigger drive to create things that feel different.</p>
<p>I'm currently learning about <span class="highlight">Artificial Intelligence and Accounting</span>, exploring how technology, creativity and business can work together. I'm especially interested in understanding AI across the board: intelligent tools, agents, systems, workflows and the businesses built around them.</p>
<p>I don't have everything figured out yet, and that's the point. This is where I document the process: what I'm learning, what I'm building, what works, what doesn't, and what I discover along the way.</p>
<p>My goal is to become an AI expert who can understand the technology, use it thoughtfully, and build or manage AI-powered businesses and automation that solve real problems.</p>
